│                          │ transit links to be paid for once and reused by all destinations. A scalable greedy       │
│                          │ shared-tree fallback is included for unusually large destination sets. The final topology │
│                          │ is materialized only after the shared network has been selected, keeping path generation  │
│                          │ separate from optimization and avoiding redundant transfers.                              │
